{"version":1,"content":"<p>DeepSeek這兩天接連出了兩條新聞，放在一起看，多少有點讓人哭笑不得。11月13日，DeepSeek宣佈開放一整套應用API。聯網搜索、深度思考搜索、讀PDF、網頁閲讀、語音識別和語音合成，開發者都可以接入自己的產品。<strong>連現成的聊天客户端代碼，官方也一併開源了</strong>。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586724.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:31.947158+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:12:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:50.383377+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:50.383377+00:00","content_hash":"88657bde8a4652f138cd0abbac2774c740eabf65e681a0ee0e7f1f79a44b45f6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}